WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.110
The splashing ended and the laughter quieted down.

2
00:00:05.111 --> 00:00:08.145
People were returning home.

3
00:00:08.146 --> 00:00:11.912
"What happens now?" Mandy asked Rishi.

4
00:00:11.913 --> 00:00:17.335
"We wash," said Rishi. "And life continues."

5
00:00:17.336 --> 00:00:20.485
Vinnie and Mandy looked around.

6
00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:23.992
They still did not know where they were.

7
00:00:23.993 --> 00:00:28.129
"Rishi, we’re new here," said Vinnie.

8
00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.405
"What is this place?"

9
00:00:30.406 --> 00:00:34.000
"The city of Patna," Rishi said.

10
00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:38.206
He noticed Vinnie and Mandy still looked confused.

11
00:00:38.207 --> 00:00:41.512
"India!" he shouted.

12
00:00:41.513 --> 00:00:45.669
"Wow!" cried Vinnie and Mandy.

13
00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:48.988
Rishi stared at them curiously.

14
00:00:48.989 --> 00:00:52.537
"Where are you from?" he asked.

15
00:00:52.538 --> 00:00:55.849
"America," said Mandy.

16
00:00:55.850 --> 00:01:02.340
"America?" repeated Rishi. "I’ve never heard of it."

17
00:01:02.341 --> 00:01:05.961
Suddenly, a young girl ran up.

18
00:01:05.962 --> 00:01:11.378
"Rishi! Mother says to come and wash," said the girl.

19
00:01:11.379 --> 00:01:15.319
"This is Rima, my sister," Rishi said.

20
00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:18.210
He introduced Vinnie and Mandy.

21
00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:21.906
"Would you like to meet my parents?" he asked.

22
00:01:21.907 --> 00:01:25.280
"We’d love to," said Mandy.

23
00:01:25.281 --> 00:01:30.045
Rishi and Rima’s house was made of mud and bamboo.

24
00:01:30.046 --> 00:01:33.288
The roof was made of palm leaves.

25
00:01:33.289 --> 00:01:37.105
A small clay stove was in a porch area.

26
00:01:37.106 --> 00:01:40.978
Rishi’s mother was stirring rice in a pot.

27
00:01:40.979 --> 00:01:45.943
His father was standing next to her wearing a white turban.

28
00:01:45.944 --> 00:01:50.284
Rishi introduced the children to his parents.

29
00:01:50.285 --> 00:01:56.260
"Hello," Vinnie and Mandy said, putting their hands together and bowing.

30
00:01:56.261 --> 00:02:00.003
Rishi’s father did the same and smiled.

31
00:02:00.004 --> 00:02:04.414
"The boys will wash first," said his father.

32
00:02:04.415 --> 00:02:09.539
Vinnie followed Rishi outside to a large jug of water.

33
00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:13.546
With a cup, Rishi scooped up some water.

34
00:02:13.547 --> 00:02:16.098
He handed it to Vinnie.

35
00:02:16.099 --> 00:02:19.409
"You wash first," said Rishi.

36
00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.627
"Thanks," replied Vinnie.

37
00:02:22.628 --> 00:02:25.672
He emptied the cup over his head.

38
00:02:25.673 --> 00:02:28.967
Shocked, Rishi stared at him.

39
00:02:28.968 --> 00:02:33.437
Then he said: "Do not waste water."

40
00:02:33.438 --> 00:02:38.434
"I’m sorry," said Vinnie, his face turning red.

41
00:02:38.435 --> 00:02:43.144
"We have a short rainy season," explained Rishi.

42
00:02:43.145 --> 00:02:47.557
"So we collect rainwater in a well outside the village."

43
00:02:47.558 --> 00:02:50.436
Rishi filled the cup again.

44
00:02:50.437 --> 00:02:55.541
He dipped his fingers in the cup and rubbed water on his arms.

45
00:02:55.542 --> 00:03:00.005
"Water is very valuable," Rishi continued.

46
00:03:00.006 --> 00:03:03.059
"We must not waste one drop."

47
00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:07.531
Embarrassed, Vinnie looked at the puddle at his feet.

48
00:03:07.532 --> 00:03:14.578
Inside the house, Mandy was looking at a row of statues on a low table.

49
00:03:14.579 --> 00:03:18.336
"What’s this?" Mandy asked.

50
00:03:18.337 --> 00:03:24.067
She pointed to a statue of a four-headed person with four arms.

51
00:03:24.068 --> 00:03:27.458
"Brahma," explained Rima.

52
00:03:27.459 --> 00:03:30.720
"He is the creator of the universe.

53
00:03:30.721 --> 00:03:34.499
Brahma is one of our three main gods."

54
00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:38.339
"Who are the others?" asked Mandy.

55
00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:42.370
There was a dark blue statue with four arms.

56
00:03:42.371 --> 00:03:45.893
Each of its arms held an object.

57
00:03:45.894 --> 00:03:51.499
"That is Vishnu, the preserver of the universe," said Rima.

58
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.707
"And this is Shiva."

59
00:03:53.708 --> 00:03:59.098
The statue of Shiva sat with its legs crossed and eyes closed.

60
00:03:59.099 --> 00:04:02.330
"The destroyer of the universe."

61
00:04:02.331 --> 00:04:06.501
Mandy looked at the smaller statues on the table.

62
00:04:06.502 --> 00:04:10.491
"Are all of these gods?" she asked.

63
00:04:10.492 --> 00:04:15.649
Rima nodded. "We worship many gods."

64
00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.271
Vinnie and Rishi returned.

65
00:04:18.272 --> 00:04:20.461
They looked cleaner.

66
00:04:20.462 --> 00:04:24.027
"It’s your turn," Vinnie said to Mandy.

67
00:04:24.028 --> 00:04:27.151
"Oh, and don’t waste water."

68
00:04:27.152 --> 00:04:36.324
Mandy gave him a puzzled look and headed outside with Rima.

